{% comment %}Content-only fallback for ingredients modal left column.{% endcomment %}
{%- capture items -%}
https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0743/5252/5487/files/s1.svg?v=1790317955|SOFTER, SMOOTHER SKIN|Pomegranate, Arctic rosehip &amp; arnica|Arnica, Pomegranate and Rosehip work together to help soften the look of fine lines and smooth skin texture.
https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0743/5252/5487/files/sunflower.png?v=1790317955|FIRMER SKIN|Natural Vitamin E|Vitamin E from Sunflowers is a natural antioxidant that helps skin look firmer and more toned.
https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0743/5252/5487/files/beeswax.svg?v=1790317955|SUPPORTS THE SKIN BARRIER|Beeswax &amp; Thistle|Locks in moisture while helping protect and support the skin barrier.
https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0743/5252/5487/files/calendula.svg?v=1790317955|CALMS AND SOOTHES|Calendula &amp; Marigold|Powerful and fast-working skin soother.
https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0743/5252/5487/files/arnica.svg?v=1790317955|BRIGHTENS THE LOOK OF DARK CIRCLES|Arctic Arnica &amp; Squalane|Helps add fullness and moisture to the delicate under-eye area.
https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0743/5252/5487/files/sea_buckthorn_smaller.svg?v=1790317955|Natural Glow|Sea Buckthorn|An exceptionally rich natural source of Vitamin C (17x oranges).
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign rows = items | strip | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
<div class="s-main-product__modal-ingredients product-ingredients">
  <div class="s-main-product__modal-content-title section-title">
    <p>10 Key Ingredients, Mixed to Work Together</p>
  </div>
  <ul class="product-ingredients__list" role="list">
    {%- for row in rows -%}
      {%- assign parts = row | strip | split: '|' -%}
      <li class="product-ingredients__item" role="listitem">
        <div class="product-ingredients__media">
          <img src="{{ parts[0] }}" alt="{{ parts[2] }}" width="240" height="240" loading="lazy" class="product-ingredients__icon">
        </div>
        <div class="product-ingredients__body">
          <span class="product-ingredients__tag">{{ parts[1] }}</span>
          <h3 class="product-ingredients__title">{{ parts[2] }}</h3>
          <div class="product-ingredients__text"><span>{{ parts[3] }}</span></div>
        </div>
      </li>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </ul>
</div>
